    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\r\n\r\nYeah, indeed, I can reproduce. And yes, the culprit is indeed that `:x` / `:x:y` are treated as line / position in string items.\r\n\r\nI'll spend some time thinking about the best solution here. Maybe somewhat surprisingly, but right now I think that the best course of action would be to say \"Avoid using semicolons in file names\" (which is a good advice in general, to be honest).",
